2026-07-22T10:52:14.570548Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019f8937-f74a-7f13-8a67-a1d0cb33b562}:submission_dispatch{otel.name="op.dispatch.user_input" submission.id="019f8972-0506-7173-9c8c-676605ea2655" codex.op="user_input"}:turn{otel.name="session_task.turn" thread.id=019f8937-f74a-7f13-8a67-a1d0cb33b562 turn.id=019f8972-0506-7173-9c8c-676605ea2655 model=gpt-5.6-luna codex.turn.reasoning_effort=medium}:model_client.stream_responses_websocket{model=gpt-5.6-luna wire_api=responses transport="responses_websocket" api.path="responses" turn.has_metadata_header=true websocket.warmup=false}:model_client.websocket_connection{provider=OpenAI wire_api=responses transport="responses_websocket" api.path="responses" turn.has_metadata_header=true}: codex_core::client: new
