2026-07-22T18:28:32.034789Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019f8937-f74a-7f13-8a67-a1d0cb33b562}:submission_dispatch{otel.name="op.dispatch.user_input" submission.id="019f8b02-78b6-7df3-b3eb-778aaec016be" codex.op="user_input"}:turn{otel.name="session_task.turn" thread.id=019f8937-f74a-7f13-8a67-a1d0cb33b562 turn.id=019f8b02-78b6-7df3-b3eb-778aaec016be model=gpt-5.6-luna codex.turn.reasoning_effort=medium}: codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec const patch = "*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/k1t94/Work/Projects/kaynann/knn-water-vending/specs/000-project-onboarding/repo-map.md\n@@\n-> Статус: приложение ещё не создано. Структура ниже является целевой для bootstrap. После создания workspace заменить предполагаемые пути и команды фактическими.\n+> Статус: bootstrap создан. Карта отражает фактическую структуру и команды текущего MVP.\n@@\n-- TypeScript.\n-- Mobile: React Native, iOS и Android.\n-- Backend: NestJS, Node.js, Swagger/OpenAPI.\n-- Data: PostgreSQL; ORM будет выбран в bootstrap-spec.\n-- Messaging: Redis, очередь фоновых задач, MQTT через `MachineGateway`.\n-- Integrations: SMS/OTP, Wave, Orange Money, FCM/APNs, карты и геолокация.\n-- Tooling: единый workspace/monorepo; package manager, Node.js LTS и test runner будут закреплены в bootstrap-spec.\n+- TypeScript.\n+- Mobile: React Native 0.81 on Expo SDK 54, iOS и Android.\n+- Backend: NestJS 11 on Node.js 24.x LTS.\n+- Data: PostgreSQL 17, Prisma 6 migrations.\n+- Local messaging: Redis 7 and Mosquitto 2 MQTT emulator.\n+- Tooling: pnpm 10.15.1 workspace; Vitest 3; ESLint 9; Prettier 3.\n+- Scope: connectivity/bootstrap only; no OTP, payments, balance, dispensing, referrals, or external providers.\n@@\n-├── apps/                             # создать на этапе bootstrap\n-│   ├── mobile/                       # React Native приложение\n-│   └── api/                          # NestJS API и background jobs\n-├── packages/                         # создать только для реально общего кода\n-│   ├── contracts/                    # API DTO/types; без бизнес-логики\n-│   └── config/                       # общие настройки tooling\n-├── infra/                            # local services и deployment config\n-├── docs/                             # краткие технические решения/инструкции\n-└── package.json                      # root workspace scripts после bootstrap\n+├── apps/\n+│   ├── mobile/                       # Expo app; entry: apps/mobile/index.ts\n+│   └── api/                          # NestJS API; entry: apps/api/src/main.ts\n+│       ├── src/config/               # validated env loading/redacted diagnostics\n+│       ├── src/health/               # bounded dependency probes and GET /health\n+│       └── prisma/                   # schema and migrations\n+├── infra/                            # Compose and Mosquitto emulator config\n+├── docs/local-development.md         # local setup and validation\n+├── scripts/                          # startup and mobile prerequisite checks\n+├── .env.example                      # safe local placeholders only\n+└── package.json                      # root workspace scripts\n@@\n-- `apps/mobile/` — точные React Native entry points записать после выбора React Native CLI/Expo и bootstrap.\n-- `apps/api/src/main.ts` — ожидаемая точка запуска NestJS HTTP API; подтвердить после bootstrap.\n-- `apps/api/src/app.module.ts` — ожидаемый composition root backend; подтвердить после bootstrap.\n-- `apps/api/src/migrations/` или ORM-equivalent — схема и миграции PostgreSQL; точный путь зависит от выбранного ORM.\n-- `infra/` — локальные PostgreSQL, Redis и MQTT broker/emulator; точные файлы записать после bootstrap.\n+- `apps/mobile/index.ts` — Expo registration entry point; `apps/mobile/src/App.tsx` — baseline screen.\n+- `apps/api/src/main.ts` — NestJS HTTP API bootstrap and lifecycle.\n+- `apps/api/src/app.module.ts` — backend composition root.\n+- `apps/api/src/health/health.controller.ts` — public `GET /health`, 200/503 contract.\n+- `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma` — Prisma datasource/generator; migrations in `apps/api/prisma/migrations/`.\n+- `infra/compose.yaml` — PostgreSQL, Redis, Mosquitto services and healthchecks.\n+- `infra/mosquitto/mosquitto.conf` — anonymous local MQTT listener only; no vending topics.\n@@\n-- `apps/api/src/**/*.spec.ts` — unit-тесты доменной и прикладной логики рядом с кодом либо в утверждённом bootstrap layout.\n-- `apps/api/test/integration/` — PostgreSQL/Redis, webhook, MQTT emulator и persistence boundaries.\n-- `apps/api/test/e2e/` — критические backend-сценарии через публичный API.\n-- `apps/mobile/src/**/*.test.ts(x)` — mobile units/components.\n-- `apps/mobile/e2e/` — основные iOS/Android пользовательские потоки, если выбранный toolchain поддерживает их в MVP.\n+- `apps/api/test/health.e2e-spec.ts` — public health contract tests.\n+- `apps/api/test/startup.smoke-spec.ts` — configuration, redaction, and bounded startup smoke tests.\n+- `apps/mobile/__tests__/App.test.tsx` — baseline Expo render test.\n@@\n-Команды ещё не существуют. В bootstrap-spec определить root scripts со стабильными именами:\n-\n-- install dependencies;\n-- start mobile/API/local services;\n-- lint;\n-- typecheck;\n-- unit tests;\n-- integration/e2e tests;\n-- build API/Android/iOS;\n-- create/apply/rollback migrations.\n-\n-После bootstrap заменить этот список точными копируемыми командами из `package.json` и инфраструктурных файлов.\n+Фактические root-команды из `package.json`:\n+\n+```sh\n+pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n+pnpm services:up\n+pnpm services:down\n+pnpm db:migrate\n+pnpm dev\n+pnpm dev:api\n+pnpm dev:mobile\n+pnpm verify:start\n+pnpm lint\n+pnpm typecheck\n+pnpm test\n+pnpm build:api\n+pnpm build:mobile:js\n+pnpm mobile:doctor\n+pnpm mobile:prebuild\n+```\n+\n+`pnpm verify:start` запускает сервисы, поднимает API через `dev:api` и\n+проверяет `GET /health`: HTTP 200, все три dependency status `up`, лимит 5\n+секунд. При недоступной зависимости ожидается HTTP 503 без зависания.\n@@\n-- `.env*`, credentials, signing keys и сертификаты; допускается чтение только безопасных example-файлов.\n+- `.env*`, credentials, signing keys и сертификаты; допускается чтение только `.env.example`.\n*** Update File: /Users/k1t94/Work/Projects/kaynann/knn-water-vending/specs/001-project-bootstrap/tasks.md\n@@\n-- [ ] T018 [P] [US1] Add healthcheck contract tests for HTTP 200 success within 5 seconds, HTTP 503 dependency failure within 5 seconds, bounded dependency timeouts, and allow-listed response fields in `apps/api/test/health.e2e-spec.ts`\n-- [ ] T019 [P] [US1] Add API startup smoke coverage for validated local configuration, redacted dependency failures, and a non-hanging healthcheck when a dependency is unreachable in `apps/api/test/startup.smoke-spec.ts`\n-- [ ] T020 [P] [US1] Add the mobile baseline bootstrap test for rendering the Expo entry point in `apps/mobile/__tests__/App.test.tsx`\n+- [x] T018 [P] [US1] Add healthcheck contract tests for HTTP 200 success within 5 seconds, HTTP 503 dependency failure within 5 seconds, bounded dependency timeouts, and allow-listed response fields in `apps/api/test/health.e2e-spec.ts`\n+- [x] T019 [P] [US1] Add API startup smoke coverage for validated local configuration, redacted dependency failures, and a non-hanging healthcheck when a dependency is unreachable in `apps/api/test/startup.smoke-spec.ts`\n+- [x] T020 [P] [US1] Add the mobile baseline bootstrap test for rendering the Expo entry point in `apps/mobile/__tests__/App.test.tsx`\n@@\n-- [ ] T021 [US1] Implement PostgreSQL, Redis, and MQTT connectivity probes with bounded latency and stable non-secret error codes in `apps/api/src/health/dependency-checks.service.ts`\n-- [ ] T022 [US1] Implement the explicitly shaped `GET /health` response and HTTP 503 failure behavior in `apps/api/src/health/health.controller.ts` and `apps/api/src/health/health.service.ts`\n-- [ ] T023 [US1] Register the health module and configure the API port/startup lifecycle in `apps/api/src/health/health.module.ts` and `apps/api/src/main.ts`\n-- [ ] T024 [US1] Create and apply the initial Prisma migration for bootstrap connectivity only in `apps/api/prisma/migrations/`\n-- [ ] T025 [US1] Implement the Expo baseline screen and development-client entry point without customer journey or business operations in `apps/mobile/src/App.tsx` and `apps/mobile/index.ts`\n-- [ ] T026 [US1] Implement headless startup verification that starts or validates services, launches the API via the `dev:api` command path, polls `GET /health`, redacts failures, and exits non-zero on error in `scripts/verify-startup.mjs`\n-- [ ] T027 [US1] Document the exact root startup commands `services:up`, `db:migrate`, `dev:api`, `dev:mobile`, `dev`, and `verify:start`, including the simulator/device prerequisite in `docs/local-development.md`\n+- [x] T021 [US1] Implement PostgreSQL, Redis, and MQTT connectivity probes with bounded latency and stable non-secret error codes in `apps/api/src/health/dependency-checks.service.ts`\n+- [x] T022 [US1] Implement the explicitly shaped `GET /health` response and HTTP 503 failure behavior in `apps/api/src/health/health.controller.ts` and `apps/api/src/health/health.service.ts`\n+- [x] T023 [US1] Register the health module and configure the API port/startup lifecycle in `apps/api/src/health/health.module.ts` and `apps/api/src/main.ts`\n+- [x] T024 [US1] Create and apply the initial Prisma migration for bootstrap connectivity only in `apps/api/prisma/migrations/`\n+- [x] T025 [US1] Implement the Expo baseline screen and development-client entry point without customer journey or business operations in `apps/mobile/src/App.tsx` and `apps/mobile/index.ts`\n+- [x] T026 [US1] Implement headless startup verification that starts or validates services, launches the API via the `dev:api` command path, polls `GET /health`, redacts failures, and exits non-zero on error in `scripts/verify-startup.mjs`\n+- [x] T027 [US1] Document the exact root startup commands `services:up`, `db:migrate`, `dev:api`, `dev:mobile`, `dev`, and `verify:start`, including the simulator/device prerequisite in `docs/local-development.md`\n*** End Patch";
