 mobile JavaScript tests.\n+- PostgreSQL 17, Redis 7, and Mosquitto 2 supplied by `infra/compose.yaml`.\n+\n+The MQTT broker is an emulator for connectivity scaffolding only. No vending\n+topic or dispense payload contract is implemented in this bootstrap.\n@@\n `verify:start` starts the API, polls `GET /health`, and succeeds only when\n PostgreSQL, Redis, and MQTT are reachable and the response is healthy within\n the required 5-second healthcheck limit. It does not print child-process logs\n or environment values.\n+\n+`.env.example` documents the local environment contract. It contains only\n+loopback endpoints and a development-only placeholder password. Copy it to\n+`.env` for local work; never add production endpoints, credentials, tokens,\n+private keys, or certificates to the example file.\n@@\n pnpm mobile:doctor\n+pnpm check:env\n+pnpm check:repo\n ```\n@@\n Native prerequisites are checked separately:\n@@\n JavaScript Expo checks remain available without native SDKs.\n*** Update File: /Users/k1t94/Work/Projects/kaynann/knn-water-vending/specs/000-project-onboarding/repo-map.md\n@@\n-├── apps/\n-│   ├── mobile/                       # Expo app; entry: apps/mobile/index.ts\n-│   └── api/                          # NestJS API; entry: apps/api/src/main.ts\n-│       ├── src/config/               # validated env loading/redacted diagnostics\n-│       ├── src/health/               # bounded dependency probes and GET /health\n-│       └── prisma/                   # schema and migrations\n-├── infra/                            # Compose and Mosquitto emulator config\n-├── docs/local-development.md         # local setup and validation\n-├── scripts/                          # startup and mobile prerequisite checks\n+├── apps/\n+│   ├── mobile/                       # Expo app; manifest and entry: apps/mobile/\n+│   │   ├── index.ts                  # Expo registration entry point\n+│   │   ├── src/App.tsx               # baseline screen\n+│   │   └── __tests__/App.test.tsx    # mobile smoke test\n+│   └── api/                          # NestJS API; manifest and entry: apps/api/\n+│       ├── src/config/               # validated env loading/redacted diagnostics\n+│       ├── src/health/               # bounded dependency probes and GET /health\n+│       ├── test/                     # API contract and startup smoke tests\n+│       └── prisma/                   # schema and migrations\n+├── infra/                            # Compose and Mosquitto emulator config\n+├── docs/local-development.md         # local setup, toolchain, and validation\n+├── scripts/                          # startup, safety, and mobile prerequisite checks\n@@\n-## Feature Areas\n+## Future Feature Areas\n@@\n-Обязательные сценарии: OTP + legal; повторный webhook; конкурентное списание;\n+These are future product areas, not implemented by the bootstrap. Обязательные\n+сценарии будущих feature: OTP + legal; повторный webhook; конкурентное списание;\n@@\n pnpm mobile:doctor\n pnpm mobile:prebuild\n+pnpm check:env\n+pnpm check:repo\n ```\n*** Update File: /Users/k1t94/Work/Projects/kaynann/knn-water-vending/specs/001-project-bootstrap/tasks.md\n@@\n-- [ ] T034 [P] [US3] Add a configuration safety check for placeholder-only environment values and forbidden secret patterns in `scripts/check-env-example.mjs`\n-- [ ] T035 [P] [US3] Add an ignore-rule/repository-map verification script for required paths and commands in `scripts/check-repo-bootstrap.mjs`\n+- [x] T034 [P] [US3] Add a configuration safety check for placeholder-only environment values and forbidden secret patterns in `scripts/check-env-example.mjs`\n+- [x] T035 [P] [US3] Add an ignore-rule/repository-map verification script for required paths and commands in `scripts/check-repo-bootstrap.mjs`\n@@\n-- [ ] T036 [US3] Update the factual onboarding map with actual application, infrastructure, entry-point, package, and validation paths in `specs/000-project-onboarding/repo-map.md`\n-- [ ] T037 [US3] 